  <Docs>
    <summary>Marks a native method to use faster Java Native Interface (JNI) transitions.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>While a fast native method executes, garbage collection cannot suspend its thread and may be blocked. Do not use this attribute on long-running methods or methods that perform significant I/O or acquire native locks that can be held for a long time. This attribute has no effect on non-native methods.</para>
      <para>
